y on legalized cannabis but back  to that remain bonus over there does  that really stack up well it all comes  back to this chart most economists think  the economy will grow more if the UK  stays inside the EU see the difference  between those top two lines there and a  stronger economy means more tax revenue  which means well a remain bonus or  whatever you want to call it but because  that's an economic forecast there's a  big risk that number isn't right  but actually that bonus is only a  relatively small fraction of their  fiscal plans and it's not even the most  surprising thing in their manifesto  which is actually rather more austere  than it looks and in some areas they may  end up being even more austere than the  Tories
 

